        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions ATL100SBR, Ornate Atlantic Acrylic Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100%\"  border=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"center\"  width=\"300\" class=\"text\">\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Atlantic Acrylic Door Pull is made in the USA by the master craftsmen at First Impressions from the finest acrylic available. The acrylic is manufactured with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading. Available in your choice of <b>Frosted or Clear Acrylic</b>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe detailed filigree end brackets of this truly unique, ornate door pull will add incredible beauty to your doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese are great pulls for <a href=\"/products/atlantic-acrylic-appliance-pull-first-impressions-ap-atl100sbr\">appliance doors</a> and <a href=\"/products/12-inch-atlantic-acrylic-shower-door-pulls-pair-first-impressions-sd-atl100012sbr\">glass shower doors</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" align=\"center\" width=\"280\" class=\"text\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-910-size.gif?v=1704354497\" width=\"260\" height=\"260\" border=\"0\" alt=\"door pull filigree detail\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the First Impressions ATL100SBR Ornate Acrylic Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Clear or Frosted Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-ATL01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262239\"><b>First Impressions ATL100SBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 4 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>ATL100009SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>ATL100012SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 9-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>ATL100018SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 15-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>ATL100024SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 21-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Ornate Acrylic Door Pull",
                "description": "First Impressions ATL100SBR Acrylic Door Pull - Available in 12 inch, 18 inch, and 24 inches long, these decorative acrylic door pulls are great as shower door pulls. The acrylic is manufactured with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading. The detailed filigree end brackets of this truly unique, ornate door pull will add incredible beauty to your doors.",
